    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0105" n="21" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg21"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prince Ferdinand to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It was with a real pleasure, especially in these sad times, that I received
                    to-day from Mr. John Brinckerhoff Jackson your autograph letter. I am very
                    content at the friendly and cordial feelings you transmit by him to myself and
                    to my Government, and I hope that the good relations between the two countries
                    shall still be more strengthened in the future.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ferdinand.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
